VioletCity_Interior8_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "Hey! I’m no trainer but I can give\n"
	.string "some advice!\p"
	.string "Believe me! If you believe, a\n"
	.string "championship dream can come true.\p"
	.string "You believe?\n"
	.string "Then listen.\p"
	.string "The grass-type is weak against the\n"
	.string "flying-type. Keep this in mind.$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "Nice battle! Keep it up, and you’ll\n"
	.string "be the CHAMP in no time at all!$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_BirdKeeperRodIntro::
	.string "The keyword is guts!\p"
	.string "Those here are training night and\n"
	.string "day to become bird POKéMON masters.\l"
	.string "Come on!$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_BirdKeeperRodDefeat::
	.string "Gaaah!$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_BirdKeeperRod::
	.string "FALKNER’s skills are for real.\p"
	.string "Don’t get cocky just because you\n"
	.string "beat me!$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_BirdKeeperAbeIntro::
	.string "Let me see if you are good enough to\n"
	.string "face FALKNER!$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_BirdKeeperAbeDefeat::
	.string "This can’t be true!$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_BirdKeeperAbe::
	.string "This is pathetic, losing to some\n"
	.string "rookie trainer...$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_LeaderFalkner2Intro::
	.string "I’m FALKNER, the VIOLET POKéMON\n"
	.string "GYM leader!\p"
	.string "People say you can clip flying-type\n"
	.string "POKéMON’s wings with a jolt of\l"
	.string "electricity…\p"
	.string "I won’t allow such insults to bird\n"
	.string "POKéMON!\p"
	.string "I’ll show you the real power of the\n"
	.string "magnificent bird POKéMON!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockDefeat::
	.string "…Darn! My Dad’s cherished bird\n"
	.string "POKéMON…\p"
	.string "All right.\n"
	.string "Take this.\p"
	.string "It’s the official POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
	.string "ZEPHYRBADGE.\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the ZEPHYRBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}\p"
	.string "ZEPHYRBADGE raises the attack\n"
	.string "power of POKéMON.\p"
	.string "It also enables POKéMON to use\n"
	.string "FLASH, if they have it, anytime.$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_LeaderFalkner2_1::
	.string "There are POKéMON GYMS in cities\n"
	.string "and towns ahead.\p"
	.string "You should test your skills at these\n"
	.string "GYMS.\p"
	.string "I’m going to train harder to become\n"
	.string "the greatest bird master!$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_LeaderFalkner2_2::
	.string "Here--take this too.$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_LeaderFalkner2_3::
	.string "By using a TM, a POKéMON will\n"
	.string "instantly learn a new move.\p"
	.string "Think before you act--a TM can be\n"
	.string "used only once.\p"
	.string "TM31 contains MUD-SLAP.\p"
	.string "It reduces the enemy’s accuracy\n"
	.string "while it causes damage.\p"
	.string "In other words, it is both defensive\n"
	.string "and offensive.$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "VIOLET CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: FALKNER\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:$"

VioletCity_Interior8_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "VIOLET CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: FALKNER\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}$"
